Package: kilobyte-parentalctl
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kilobyte contributors <kilobyte@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jgm240/kilobyte
Depends: python3, nftables, systemd, procps, libpam-modules
Description: Kilobyte's parental controls
 For the children's accounts of a Kilobyte computer: time per day (school
 days and weekends), allowed hours, programs turned off, and the Internet
 always, never or only in computer time; extra time today and a report.
 Set up in Kilobyte's Settings > Parental controls. Installed with
 "kbutils dl parentalctl".
